      "lineNbr": 686,
      "author": {
        "id": 1308504
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-05-22T05:54:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, we shouldn\u0027t do this. they are used to configure a static address rather than request a LinkAddress from PrivateAddressCoordinator.\n\nmStaticIpv4ServerAddr: this is used for static address configuration and be specified from TetheringRequest. This configuration is not related to scope.\n\nshouldNotConfigureBluetoothInterface: current we only support global mode of bluetooth tethering which means isLocalOnly always be false for bluetooth. Thus, checking isLocalOnly is unnecessary. \n\n    private boolean shouldNotConfigureBluetoothInterface() {\n        // Before T, bluetooth tethering configures the interface elsewhere.\n        return (mInterfaceType \u003d\u003d TetheringManager.TETHERING_BLUETOOTH) \u0026\u0026 !SdkLevel.isAtLeastT();\n    }",
      "parentUuid": "b1dd1930_62ac203b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 684,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 686,
        "endChar": 97
      },
      "revId": "1df3bab29fcda1fae6491c610554a3283695116a",
